\begin{enumerate}[nosep,leftmargin=*]
    \item \textbf{Failure mode identification.} We identify CIVO as specific to imagination-based actor-critic with temporal conditioning. Factorial analysis isolates trained $\dt$-embedding $+$ multi-rate exposure as jointly sufficient (5/7 locomotion seeds, 0/16 controls). The NVE $\geq 2.0\times$ threshold achieves perfect classification ($n{=}36$; AUROC${=}1.000$, F1${=}1.000$; 9 CIVO-positive vs.\ 27 non-CIVO); cross-environment validation confirms specificity to multi-joint locomotion (\S\ref{sec:discussion}).
